<title>JAPAN: Matsushita Communication jumps on solid earnings.</title>
<headline>Matsushita Communication jumps on solid earnings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Matsushita Communication Industrial Co Ltd jumped on Friday morning, boosted by the firm's solid earnings released the previous day, traders said.</p>
<p>As of 0050 GMT, the share price of the communications equipment manufacturer was up 80 yen at 3,090 yen. Volume was 569,000 shares.</p>
